Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Lluwen, Imperfect Naturalist
Island x4
Lightning Bolt
Grizzly Bears
Forest
Giant Growth
Island
Island x7

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
